sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant Svc as Service
    participant Dep as Dependency
    participant Mon as Monitoring
    U->>Svc: request
    Svc->>Dep: call
    alt dependency healthy
        Dep-->>Svc: response
        Svc-->>U: success
    else dependency slow
        Svc->>Svc: timeout fires before the user gives up
        Svc-->>U: degraded but bounded response
        Note over Svc: reliability is tolerating faults, not avoiding them
    else dependency down
        Svc->>Svc: breaker open, shed load
        Svc-->>U: fail fast with a clear error
    end
    Svc->>Mon: latency, errors, saturation
    Mon-->>Svc: percentiles, not averages
    Note over Mon: p99 is the experience your busiest users actually get
